<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! face.handle.attests ~ a structured edge: this Handle stands in a named relation

`lares handle attest --surface <kind> --subject <name>` mints a signed statement that this Handle stands in a named relation to a named foreign subject (surfaces: dns-control, atproto-account, kowloon-actor, loopback-address) and prints it for the operator to carry. `--return-locator` names where the surface half looks; `--persona` the persona. A closed vocabulary refuses an unknown surface by name.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ dns

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`dns` params=`surface/dns-control subject/example.net ~ claim control of a zone`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ surface · subject · return-locator · persona

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`surface` params=`takes/kind needs/required ~ the adapter row: dns-control, atproto-account, kowloon-actor or loopback-address`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`subject` params=`takes/name needs/required ~ the foreign name in that surface's grammar`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`return-locator` params=`takes/where ~ where the surface half looks for the leg coming back`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`persona` params=`takes/index ~ the persona whose Handle acts; absent, the store door's default`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ hand

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`hand` params=`who/seat-or-hand key/handle-head ~ the store door signs on the WHO board under the Handle's key`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ usage · store-refused

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`usage` params=`cure/[[face.handle.attests surface/dns-control subject/example.net]] ~ attest wants --surface and --subject, and an adapter that answers them`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`store-refused` params=`~ the store door refused; the line names why`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ statement

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`statement` params=`exit/0 ~ the signed statement as one JSON line`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins`>>

!! skins ~ cli

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins/cli`>>

!!! lares handle attest

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`skin` name=`cli` params=`handler/host spells/[[lares handle attest]] ~ the terminal`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

